 </div></h1>
<h1 id=3D"PRDCXApplicationStatus-FeaturePositioning">Feature Positioning&nb=
sp;</h1>
<h2 id=3D"PRDCXApplicationStatus-FeatureOverview">Feature Overview</h2>
<p class=3D"aha-editor__anchor-copy-link-container"><strong><span>Product G=
oals&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<ul class=3D"">
 <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child">
  <p class=3D""><span>Enable NBIN teams to effectively communicate the syst=
em status within new Compass by providing users with updates such as ongoin=
g bugs, resolution, workarounds and planned maintenance activities.</span><=
/p></li>
 <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child">
  <p class=3D""><span><span>Reduce inbound inquires and negative sentiment =
regarding being reactive by providing users with a </span><span>proactive <=
/span></span><span><span>view of application status - monitoring (modify go=
al - proactive)</span></span></p></li>
</ul>
<p class=3D""><strong><span>Target Audience&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<ul class=3D"">
 <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child">
  <p class=3D""><span>All firms &amp; CX Users</span></p></li>
 <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child">
  <p class=3D""><span>NBIN Product Support</span></p></li>
</ul>
<p><span style=3D"color:#1d7afc;"><em>Describe why we have prioritized this=
 feature and who does it benefit / what problem does it solve?</em></span><=
/p>
<h2 id=3D"PRDCXApplicationStatus-ProblemStatement">Problem Statement</h2>
<p class=3D"aha-editor__anchor-copy-link-container"><br></p>
<p class=3D"aha-editor__anchor-copy-link-container"><br></p>
<h2 class=3D"aha-editor__anchor-copy-link-container" id=3D"PRDCXApplication=
Status-BenefitHypothesis"><strong><span>Benefit Hypothesis</span></strong><=
/h2>
<p class=3D"aha-editor__anchor-copy-link-container"><strong><span>Benefit C=
ase</span></strong></p>
<p class=3D""><span>Reach =3D 7</span><span> | effects all users of CX toda=
y both internal and external.</span></p>
<p class=3D""><span>Impact =3D 3 </span><span>| usage metrics currently not=
 available to support the actual views of status indicators or hover over m=
essaging however, we currently have 1077 R2 users who have opted for email =
notifications for Application Status Update.</span></p>
<p class=3D""><span>Benefits to NBIN</span></p>
<ul class=3D"">
 <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child">
  <p class=3D""><span>R2 decom - Feature allows us to decom the existing R2=
 traffic lights feature</span></p></li>
 <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child">
  <p class=3D""><span>Operational Efficiency: Reduce manual efforts that se=
rvice and support teams spend on responding to client queries due to existi=
ng R2 traffic lights limitations and existing user experience. </span></p><=
/li>
 <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child">
  <p class=3D""><span>Improved Communication: Users can view real time upda=
tes about status updates and system health for </span></p></li>
 <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child">
  <p class=3D""><span>Trust and Engagement: Enables transparent communicati=
on and encourages continued interaction with CX resulting in increased adop=
tion</span></p></li>
 <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child">
  <p class=3D""><span>Enablement: New capability for communicating system i=
ssues &amp; release downtimes for new Compass features. Currently the same =
is done through email.</span></p></li>
</ul>
<p class=3D""><span>Benefits to Users</span></p>
<ul class=3D"">
 <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child">
  <p class=3D""><span>User Experience: Improved experience as users will be=
 able to view details of active incidents for all applications in one view&=
nbsp;</span></p></li>
 <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child">
  <p class=3D""><span>Task Efficiency: </span></p>
  <ul class=3D"">
   <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child">
    <p class=3D""><span><span>Users will be able to view Application status=
 in CX thereby reducing the additional effort of navigating to R2 to view t=
raffic lights of features and applications available in R2. </span></span><=
/p></li>
   <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child">
    <p class=3D""><span><span>Users will be able to review the application =
status for new Compass features on the platform and will reduce the relianc=
e on email communication from Prod Support or on communication from their f=
irm admins.</span></span></p></li>
   <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child">
    <p class=3D""><span><span>More clarity on issues reducing the need for =
users to communicate with service teams to understand workarounds for new C=
ompass issues.</span></span></p></li>
  </ul></li>
</ul>
<h2 id=3D"PRDCXApplicationStatus-TargetAudience">Target Audience</h2>
<p><span style=3D"color:#1d7afc;"><em>Describe ALL target users.</em></span=
></p>
<ul>
 <li>
  <p>All internal and firm users</p></li>
</ul>
<h1 id=3D"PRDCXApplicationStatus-FeatureScope">Feature Scope</h1>
<p><span style=3D"color:#1d7afc;"><em>Describe expected behaviors and scena=
rios from a user or business perspective.</em></span></p>
<p class=3D"_anchorCopyLinkContainer_v7e9h_9"><span><u>FIGMA File:</u></spa=
n></p>
<p><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://www.figma.com/design/7NVyhTHE=
xB0QmxeHN2Gwji/Feature-Status-Management?node-id=3D132-3069&amp;t=3D7uvnOeO=
k9aHjs4mK-1" rel=3D"nofollow">https://www.figma.com/design/7NVyhTHExB0QmxeH=
N2Gwji/Feature-Status-Management?node-id=3D132-3069&amp;t=3D7uvnOeOk9aHjs4m=
K-1</a></p>
<p>PW: FSM</p>
<p class=3D"_anchorCopyLinkContainer_v7e9h_9"><span><u>MVP 1.27 SCOPE:</u>&=
nbsp;</span></p>
<ul class=3D"">
 <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child">
  <p class=3D""><span>Ability to create incidents and scheduled maintenance=
 banners which will be visible to all users</span></p></li>
 <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child">
  <p class=3D""><span>No role/firm/feature access targeting capabilities</s=
pan></p></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Firm Users:</strong></p>
<ul>
 <li>CX users will be able to view the <strong>System Health Icon or Applic=
ation Status Icon </strong>in the top navigation menu=20
  <ul>
   <li>Greyed out - When the health indicator is grey it would imply that t=
here are active incidents.</li>
   <li>Red indicator - it would imply that there are new incidents that hav=
e been identified</li>
  </ul></li>
</ul>
<p><br></p>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper"><img class=3D"confluenc=
e-embedded-image confluence-external-resource" draggable=3D"false" src=3D""=
 data-image-src=3D""></span><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper=
"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" src=3D"62ed2=
e3a09cac27601966bcc873968914663cb1dc38e96e8cfc722eedb270d8c" data-image-src=
