default-alias=3D"image-2025-6-18_12-36-7.png" data-base-url=3D"https://wiki=
.bnc.ca" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resour=
ce-container-id=3D"2260668960" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"16=
" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" width=3D"369" height=3D"102"></span></p>
<p><br></p>
<ul>
 <li>Through this indicator users can access the <strong>System Health Page=
 or Application Status</strong> <strong>Page </strong>which will provide th=
e following details=20
  <ul>
   <li>Active incidents - would be categorized as either Outage or Degraded=
 performance based on the severity of the incident</li>
   <li>Scheduled maintenance - downtimes</li>
   <li>Resolved incidents - will be visible for up to 24hrs after resolutio=
n</li>
  </ul></li>
</ul>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" heigh=
t=3D"496" src=3D"5c20d5c3f1781a381c1241f65db73e50859c08857845c5c75245fe2cff=
3e7f18" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/2260668960/image-2025-6-17_=
16-16-58.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1750191418373&amp;api=3Dv2"=
 data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"2300980483"=
 data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment=
" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-2025-6-17_16-16-58.png" data-=
base-url=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image=
/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"2260668960" data-linked-resource=
-container-version=3D"16" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" width=3D"468"></span></p>
<ul>
 <li>The system downtimes will be communicated through the Scheduled banner=
 which can be dismissed by user or will be hidden post the downtime is comp=
leted</li>
</ul>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper"><img class=3D"confluenc=
e-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" src=3D"d55d3bbd5acfc7c8886963f5e7e7b2=
d24dd6b4dc6e9649791a24c9e886cb4637" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments=
/2260668960/image-2025-6-18_12-50-45.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=
=3D1750265445056&amp;api=3Dv2" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-lin=
ked-resource-id=3D"2300984115" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-link=
ed-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image=
-2025-6-18_12-50-45.png" data-base-url=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca" data-linked-=
