=3D"" width=3D"468" height=3D"13"></span></p>
<ul>
 <li>Coverage:<strong>&nbsp; </strong>Incidents and down times for all appl=
ications &amp; features within the NBIN ecosystem can be communicated throu=
gh this feature</li>
</ul>
<p><br></p>
<p><strong>NBIN Users</strong></p>
<p><strong>Product Support:</strong></p>
<ul>
 <li>Incidents and downtimes can be created, edited and resolved through th=
e System Events module.=20
  <ul>
   <li>Users need to select the feature, status, target audience and enter =
event details</li>
   <li>Status that are available - Degraded Performance, Outage, Operationa=
l (to resolve the incidents)</li>
   <li>Targeting that is available - Firm, role, feature access (either one=
 can be selected)</li>
  </ul></li>
</ul>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
