<p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
<h1 class=3D"_anchorCopyLinkContainer_v7e9h_9" id=3D"PRDCXApplicationStatus=
-KeyCapabilities">Key Capabilities</h1>
<p><strong>Product Support:</strong></p>
<ul>
 <li>Targeting that is available - Firm, role, feature access (either one c=
an be selected)</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Product:</strong></p>
<ul>
 <li>Users to register and edit Features through the Features module</li>
 <li><strong><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-emb=
edded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"fa=
lse" height=3D"278" src=3D"965e24e09f2ef4f9e1e7fc6e22514b8a428ad0da8f111a34=
