d-resource-container-version=3D"16" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" width=3D"468"><=
/span></strong></li>
</ul>
<p><span>Known Issues</span></p>
<p><span style=3D"color:#1d7afc;"><em>Describe any PLANNED product gaps, co=
nstraints, operational workarounds, user frictions that will not be solved =
but are known to cause issues once launched.</em></span></p>
<ul>
 <li>TBC</li>
</ul>
<h1 id=3D"PRDCXApplicationStatus-OperationalImpact&amp;Considerations"><spa=
n>Operational Impact &amp; Considerations</span></h1>
<p><span style=3D"color:#1d7afc;"><em>Notes for planning the roll-out or im=
plications of this feature to users.</em></span></p>
<ul>
 <li><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">The feature will be visible to all CX u=
sers.</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style=3D"color:#1d7afc;"><em>Notes for planning the roll-out of th=
is feature to internal teams.</em></span></p>
<ul>
 <li>Automated email notification service is out of scope for this feature.=
</li>
 <li>Prod Support users can stop using the R2 application management featur=
e for incident communication through traffic lights.</li>
 <li>In case of missing features or addition of features in Application Sta=
tus - Product Support would need to reach out to the Product tea</li>
</ul>
<p><br></p>
<h1 id=3D"PRDCXApplicationStatus-FeatureDistribution">Feature Distribution<=
/h1>
